    "subject": "MapPgShardKeyAttribute",
    "trigger": "a caller constructs it with a shard identifier name and a record identity name, optionally followed by up to four subordinate identity names and an explicit record-identifier flag",
    "response": "configure the supplied shard identifier as a PostgreSQL smallint mapping and retain the supplied identity names as selectors for the virtual compound key",
    "postcondition": "the record-identifier selector is true for overloads without the Boolean argument and equals the supplied Boolean for overloads with it"
